From fd0ef116005eef9d953b11921ba6ddc9e1171448 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BearddOddity <beardedoddity@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 07:21:54 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 10/13] Beardd's Wayfarer 1.1.1: the compass's diamond takes
 the waypoint diamond's colour, not the trail's

The player: "the icon shouldn't match the trail, just the diamond icon should match the diamond compass icon". The waypoint
asks dfo.markColour(diamondColour(kind, look)) as the mark changes - the quest's look, a place's kind; gold and the waypoint
off leave the game's own. The guide trail colours nothing. Modules 1.1.1.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
